    {
      "id": "bTyFJbpgYkbSXSbzselpi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2503.212609746991,
      "y": 144.27601762263112,
      "width": 286,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1198829390,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 1408969742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785208422171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here we build foundation\nmodel according to company\nusecase.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here we build foundation\nmodel according to company\nusecase.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qbS3UOMQ8nyYs_lJGZFUk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1764.298547246991,
      "y": 332.4244551226311,
      "width": 1177,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1544926478,
      "version": 1720,
      "versionNonce": 1405346958,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785209186923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prompt Engineering -> Here we can talk to LLM in english or any language, we can also redefine our\n    question, so that we get good answer, that is what prompt engineering is, Here we are using already\n    build LLM, so this will go into user perspective category.\n\nRLHF(Reinforcement Learning with the help of Human feedback) -> using this technology we can modify\n    behaviour of LLM, we can safeguard LLM , so that it will not tell nonsence. or not use any wrong\n    word, this is used in process of LLM building, hence it will go under Builder perspective Category.\n\nRAG -> Here from any given LLM, we can get answer based on our document or private data. again this is\n    user perspective\n\nPretraining -> Here we take foundation model and train by giving huge amount of data on a big hardware.\n    since it is process of building LLM , it will go under Builder perspective.\n\nQuantization -> This is a process where we can optimize our model, and we can run this in diff diff\n    environment. Builder perspective.\n\nAI Agents -> Here we can create software with the help of LLMs, this will not only do question answering\n    but at the same time it can do other things as well like, it can book ticket for us. User perspective\n\nVector Database -> It used while implementation of RAG, hence it will go under user perspective\n\nFine Tuning -> this is both as we can do fine tuning at the time of LLM building, also at the time of using\n    LLM models.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prompt Engineering -> Here we can talk to LLM in english or any language, we can also redefine our\n    question, so that we get good answer, that is what prompt engineering is, Here we are using already\n    build LLM, so this will go into user perspective category.\n\nRLHF(Reinforcement Learning with the help of Human feedback) -> using this technology we can modify\n    behaviour of LLM, we can safeguard LLM , so that it will not tell nonsence. or not use any wrong\n    word, this is used in process of LLM building, hence it will go under Builder perspective Category.\n\nRAG -> Here from any given LLM, we can get answer based on our document or private data. again this is\n    user perspective\n\nPretraining -> Here we take foundation model and train by giving huge amount of data on a big hardware.\n    since it is process of building LLM , it will go under Builder perspective.\n\nQuantization -> This is a process where we can optimize our model, and we can run this in diff diff\n    environment. Builder perspective.\n\nAI Agents -> Here we can create software with the help of LLMs, this will not only do question answering\n    but at the same time it can do other things as well like, it can book ticket for us. User perspective\n\nVector Database -> It used while implementation of RAG, hence it will go under user perspective\n\nFine Tuning -> this is both as we can do fine tuning at the time of LLM building, also at the time of using\n    LLM models.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nzXFel5nEnVjZ5Vwekd_D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.282922246991,
      "y": 1064.4010176226311,
      "width": 968,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2036855378,
      "version": 140,
      "versionNonce": 1416941714,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785209335042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Builders Perspective -> here we need knowledge of ML and deep learning as a prerequisite\n\n\nUser perspective ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Builders Perspective -> here we need knowledge of ML and deep learning as a prerequisite\n\n\nUser perspective ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZHQnPEG9zNAcl-BtUeEe2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1883.896203496991,
      "y": 1159.0533613726311,
      "width": 11,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
